#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:69
msgid "New: EU order withdrawal button"
msgstr "Nua: cnaipe tarraingthe siar ó ordú AE"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:70
msgid ""
"From 19 June 2026, online shops selling to consumers in the EU must offer an "
"easy way to withdraw from a contract online (Directive (EU) 2023/2673). This "
"plugin now adds a withdrawal form, a \"Withdraw from contract\" button in "
"the footer and header menu, and a Withdraw button in My account, with "
"confirmation emails and a list of requests to confirm or reject."
msgstr ""
"Ó 19 Meitheamh 2026, ní mór do shiopaí ar líne a dhíolann le tomhaltóirí san "
"AE bealach éasca a chur ar fáil chun tarraingt siar ó chonradh ar líne "
"(Treoir (AE) 2023/2673). Cuireann an breiseán seo foirm tarraingthe siar "
"leis anois, cnaipe \"Tarraing siar ón gconradh\" i roghchlár an bhuntásc "
"agus an cheanntásc, agus cnaipe \"Tarraing siar\" i Mo chuntas, le "
"ríomhphoist dheimhnithe agus liosta iarratas le deimhniú nó le diúltú."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:72
msgid ""
"Your withdrawal page is live. Review the settings and manage incoming "
"requests under EU Guarantee & GARAN → Withdrawals."
msgstr ""
"Tá do leathanach tarraingthe siar beo. Athbhreithnigh na socruithe agus "
"bainistigh iarratais isteach faoi Ráthaíocht AE agus GARAN → Tarraingtí siar."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:73
msgid ""
"A \"Withdraw from contract\" page has been created as a draft, so nothing "
"has changed on your shop yet. Review the settings, then publish the page to "
"switch it on."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíodh leathanach \"Tarraing siar ón gconradh\" mar dhréacht, mar sin "
"níl aon rud athraithe ar do shiopa fós. Athbhreithnigh na socruithe, ansin "
"foilsigh an leathanach chun é a chur ar siúl."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:75
msgid "Set up withdrawals"
msgstr "Socraigh tarraingtí siar"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:76 admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:106
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Ruaig"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:100
msgid "EU Legal-Guarantee Notice & GARAN Durability Label is active."
msgstr ""
"Tá Fógra Ráthaíochta Dlíthiúla AE agus Lipéad Marthanachta GARAN gníomhach."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:102
msgid ""
"The legal-guarantee notice is already showing on your product pages. Choose "
"its language, placement and look, and switch on checkout and email copies, "
"in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Tá an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla á thaispeáint cheana féin ar leathanaigh "
"do tháirgí. Roghnaigh a theanga, a shuíomh agus a chuma, agus cumasaigh "
"cóipeanna don seiceáil amach agus do ríomhphoist, sna socruithe."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:103
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is not active, so place the notice yourself with the "
"[eu_guarantee_notice] shortcode or the \"EU Guarantee Notice\" block. Choose "
"its language and look in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Níl WooCommerce gníomhach, mar sin cuir an fógra isteach tú féin leis an "
"gcód gairid [eu_guarantee_notice] nó leis an mbloc \"EU Guarantee Notice\". "
"Roghnaigh a theanga agus a chuma sna socruithe."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:105
msgid "Open settings"
msgstr "Oscail na socruithe"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:115
msgid ""
"Is the EU Guarantee Notice & GARAN Label plugin helping your shop get ready "
"for the new EU rules? A short review on WordPress.org helps other shop "
"owners find it — it takes a minute."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil an breiseán EU Guarantee Notice & GARAN Label ag cabhrú le do "
"shiopa ullmhú do rialacha nua an AE? Cabhraíonn léirmheas gearr ar "
"WordPress.org le húinéirí siopaí eile é a aimsiú — ní thógann sé ach nóiméad."

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:118
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Fág léirmheas"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:119
msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "B'fhéidir níos déanaí"

#: admin/class-eggl-admin-notices.php:120
msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Ná fiafraigh arís"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:16
msgid "EU legal-guarantee notice"
msgstr "Fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla AE"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:20
msgid "GARAN durability label"
msgstr "Lipéad marthanachta GARAN"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:50
msgid "EU guarantee"
msgstr "Ráthaíocht AE"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:52
msgid "Open the EU Guarantee settings"
msgstr "Oscail socruithe EU Guarantee"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:64
msgid "The legal-guarantee notice is switched off"
msgstr "Tá an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla múchta"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:65
msgid ""
"The notice is turned off in the plugin settings, so it is not shown "
"anywhere. Every trader selling goods to EU consumers must display it — turn "
"\"Enable\" back on."
msgstr ""
"Tá an fógra múchta i socruithe an bhreiseáin, mar sin ní thaispeántar é áit "
"ar bith. Ní mór do gach trádálaí a dhíolann earraí le tomhaltóirí AE é a "
"thaispeáint — cas \"Cumasaigh\" air arís."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:74
msgid "The legal-guarantee notice artwork is missing"
msgstr "Tá saothar ealaíne an fhógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla ar iarraidh"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:75
msgid ""
"The official notice image files are missing from the plugin folder, so the "
"notice cannot be shown anywhere. Reinstall the plugin to restore them."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhaid íomhá oifigiúla an fhógra ar iarraidh ó fhillteán an bhreiseáin, "
"mar sin ní féidir an fógra a thaispeáint áit ar bith. Athshuiteáil an "
"breiseán chun iad a athchóiriú."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:80
msgid "The notice is shown in English instead of your language"
msgstr "Taispeántar an fógra i mBéarla in ionad do theanga féin"

#. translators: %s: language code, e.g. "de"
#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:82
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The official notice for your display language (%s) is missing from the "
"plugin folder, so the English version is shown instead. Reinstall the plugin "
"to restore it."
msgstr ""
"Tá an fógra oifigiúil do do theanga taispeána (%s) ar iarraidh ó fhillteán "
"an bhreiseáin, mar sin taispeántar an leagan Béarla ina ionad. Athshuiteáil "
"an breiseán chun é a athchóiriú."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:89
msgid "The legal-guarantee notice is not placed automatically"
msgstr "Ní chuirtear an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla isteach go huathoibríoch"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:90
msgid ""
"Automatic placement on product pages, the checkout and order emails needs "
"WooCommerce. Without it, add the [eu_guarantee_notice] shortcode or the \"EU "
"Guarantee Notice\" block to your pages yourself — this plugin cannot see "
"where you put it, so it cannot check that for you."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn WooCommerce le haghaidh socrú uathoibríoch ar leathanaigh táirgí, "
"ar an seiceáil amach agus i ríomhphoist ordaithe. Gan é, cuir an cód gairid "
"[eu_guarantee_notice] nó an bloc \"EU Guarantee Notice\" le do leathanaigh "
"tú féin — ní féidir leis an mbreiseán seo a fheiceáil cá gcuireann tú é, mar "
"sin ní féidir leis é sin a sheiceáil duit."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:95
msgid "product pages"
msgstr "leathanaigh táirgí"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:96
msgid "the checkout"
msgstr "an seiceáil amach"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:97
msgid "order confirmation emails"
msgstr "ríomhphoist deimhnithe ordaithe"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:98
msgid "the site header"
msgstr "ceanntásc an tsuímh"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:102
msgid "The legal-guarantee notice is shown automatically"
msgstr "Taispeántar an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla go huathoibríoch"

#. translators: %s: list of places, e.g. "product pages, the checkout"
#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:104
#, php-format
msgid "Shown on %s."
msgstr "Taispeánta ar: %s."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:115
msgid "The GARAN label is placed manually"
msgstr "Cuirtear an lipéad GARAN isteach de láimh"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:116
msgid ""
"Without WooCommerce, add the [eu_garan years=\"…\" brand=\"…\" model=\"…\"] "
"shortcode or the \"GARAN Label\" block wherever a product carries a "
"qualifying durability guarantee."
msgstr ""
"Gan WooCommerce, cuir an cód gairid [eu_garan years=\"…\" brand=\"…\" "
"model=\"…\"] nó an bloc \"GARAN Label\" isteach cibé áit a bhfuil ráthaíocht "
"marthanachta incháilithe ag táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:126
msgid "The GARAN label is switched off"
msgstr "Tá an lipéad GARAN múchta"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:127
msgid ""
"No product has a qualifying durability guarantee filled in, so nothing is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Níl ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe líonta isteach ag táirge ar bith, "
"mar sin níl aon rud ar iarraidh."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:132
msgid "The GARAN label is switched off, but products qualify for it"
msgstr "Tá an lipéad GARAN múchta, ach tá táirgí incháilithe dó"

#. translators: %d: number of products
#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:134
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d product has a qualifying durability guarantee, but the GARAN label is "
"turned off site-wide, so it is not shown."
msgid_plural ""
"%d products have a qualifying durability guarantee, but the GARAN label is "
"turned off site-wide, so it is not shown."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tá ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe ag %d táirge, ach tá an lipéad GARAN "
"múchta ar fud an tsuímh, mar sin ní thaispeántar é."
msgstr[1] ""
"Tá ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe ag %d tháirge, ach tá an lipéad GARAN "
"múchta ar fud an tsuímh, mar sin ní thaispeántar é."
msgstr[2] ""
"Tá ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe ag %d tháirge, ach tá an lipéad GARAN "
"múchta ar fud an tsuímh, mar sin ní thaispeántar é."
msgstr[3] ""
"Tá ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe ag %d dtáirge, ach tá an lipéad GARAN "
"múchta ar fud an tsuímh, mar sin ní thaispeántar é."
msgstr[4] ""
"Tá ráthaíocht marthanachta incháilithe ag %d táirge, ach tá an lipéad GARAN "
"múchta ar fud an tsuímh, mar sin ní thaispeántar é."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:141
msgid "No product carries a GARAN label yet"
msgstr "Níl lipéad GARAN ar tháirge ar bith go fóill"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:142
msgid ""
"The label only applies where the producer offers a free, whole-product "
"durability guarantee of more than 2 years. Fill in the EU Guarantee tab on "
"those products (or upload a vendor label) and it appears automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhaineann an lipéad ach amháin nuair a thairgeann an monaróir ráthaíocht "
"marthanachta saor in aisce ar an táirge iomlán ar feadh níos mó ná 2 "
"bhliain. Líon isteach an cluaisín EU Guarantee ar na táirgí sin (nó "
"uaslódáil lipéad díoltóra) agus taispeánfar é go huathoibríoch."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:148
msgid "The GARAN label is shown automatically"
msgstr "Taispeántar an lipéad GARAN go huathoibríoch"

#. translators: %d: number of products
#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:150
#, php-format
msgid "%d product shows the GARAN label."
msgid_plural "%d products show the GARAN label."
msgstr[0] "Taispeánann %d táirge an lipéad GARAN."
msgstr[1] "Taispeánann %d tháirge an lipéad GARAN."
msgstr[2] "Taispeánann %d tháirge an lipéad GARAN."
msgstr[3] "Taispeánann %d dtáirge an lipéad GARAN."
msgstr[4] "Taispeánann %d táirge an lipéad GARAN."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:161
msgid "Some GARAN labels have text that is too long"
msgstr "Tá téacs rófhada ar roinnt lipéad GARAN"

#. translators: %s: list of product names
#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:163
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The brand, model or duration is too wide for the official label on: %s. It "
"is squeezed to fit — shorten it on the product's EU Guarantee tab."
msgstr ""
"Tá an branda, an tsamhail nó an fad róleathan don lipéad oifigiúil ar: %s. "
"Brúitear é chun é a chur in oiriúint — giorraigh é ar chluaisín EU Guarantee "
"an táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:170
msgid "The GARAN label is not shown at checkout"
msgstr "Ní thaispeántar an lipéad GARAN ag an seiceáil amach"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:171
msgid ""
"Article 8(2) of the Consumer Rights Directive names the durability label "
"among the information to show directly before the order is placed. Turn on "
"\"Checkout page\" in the GARAN settings."
msgstr ""
"Ainmníonn Airteagal 8(2) den Treoir um Chearta Tomhaltóirí an lipéad "
"marthanachta i measc na faisnéise atá le taispeáint díreach sula ndéantar an "
"t-ordú. Cumasaigh \"Leathanach an tseiceála amach\" i socruithe GARAN."

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:180
msgid "Your server cannot draw GARAN label images for emails"
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir le do fhreastalaí íomhánna lipéad GARAN a tharraingt do ríomhphoist"

#: admin/class-eggl-health.php:181
msgid ""
"PHP's GD image extension (with FreeType) is missing, so label images for "
"emails are drawn in your browser instead whenever you open a product in the "
"editor. Until a product has been opened once, its emails carry a text line "
"with a link. Ask your host to enable GD for fully automatic images."
msgstr ""
"Tá síneadh íomhá GD de chuid PHP (le FreeType) ar iarraidh, mar sin "
"tarraingítear íomhánna lipéid do ríomhphoist i do bhrabhsálaí ina ionad sin "
"gach uair a osclaíonn tú táirge san eagarthóir. Go dtí go n-osclófar táirge "
"uair amháin, beidh líne théacs le nasc ina ríomhphoist. Iarr ar d'óstach GD "
"a chumasú le haghaidh íomhánna go hiomlán uathoibríoch."

