#: gpsr/includes/class-eggl-gpsr-settings.php:102
#: price-history/modules/digital-price-list/admin.php:198
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Ardsocruithe"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:192
msgid "Plugin credit"
msgstr "Creidiúint an bhreiseáin"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:194
#: gpsr/includes/class-eggl-gpsr-settings.php:107
msgid "On plugin deletion"
msgstr "Ar scriosadh an bhreiseáin"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:199
msgid ""
"Settings that apply site-wide, to both the legal-guarantee notice and the "
"GARAN label."
msgstr ""
"Socruithe a bhaineann leis an suíomh iomlán, don fhógra ráthaíochta "
"dlíthiúla agus don lipéad GARAN araon."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:203
msgid ""
"Everything related to the harmonised EU legal-guarantee notice: where and "
"how it appears."
msgstr ""
"Gach rud a bhaineann leis an bhfógra comhchuibhithe ráthaíochta dlíthiúla "
"AE: cá háit agus conas a thaispeántar é."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:207
msgid ""
"Everything related to the GARAN commercial durability label: where and how "
"it appears. Set the manufacturer guarantee per product under Product data → "
"EU Guarantee."
msgstr ""
"Gach rud a bhaineann leis an lipéad tráchtála marthanachta GARAN: cá háit "
"agus conas a thaispeántar é. Socraigh ráthaíocht an mhonaróra do gach táirge "
"faoi Sonraí an Táirge → EU Guarantee."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:208
msgid ""
"Edit a WooCommerce product and open the \"EU Guarantee\" tab in the product "
"data box. Fill Guarantee duration, brand and model there and the label "
"appears on that product."
msgstr ""
"Cuir táirge WooCommerce in eagar agus oscail an cluaisín \"EU Guarantee\" i "
"mbosca sonraí an táirge. Líon isteach fad na ráthaíochta, an branda agus an "
"tsamhail ansin agus taispeánfar an lipéad ar an táirge sin."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:212
msgid ""
"Housekeeping: plugin credit and what happens to your settings on removal."
msgstr ""
"Cothabháil: creidiúint an bhreiseáin agus a tharlaíonn do do chuid socruithe "
"nuair a bhaintear é."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:294
#, php-format
msgid "Automatic — matches your site language (currently %s)"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch — meaitseálann sé teanga do shuímh (%s faoi láthair)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:300
msgid ""
"Language of the official legal-guarantee notice (Annex I). \"Automatic\" "
"follows your site's own language (Settings → General → Site Language) and "
"updates if that ever changes; pick a specific language instead to keep the "
"notice fixed regardless of site language."
msgstr ""
"Teanga an fhógra oifigiúil ráthaíochta dlíthiúla (Iarscríbhinn I). Leanann "
"\"Uathoibríoch\" teanga do shuímh féin (Socruithe → Ginearálta → Teanga an "
"tSuímh) agus nuashonraítear é má athraíonn sí riamh; roghnaigh teanga "
"shonrach ina ionad sin chun an fógra a choinneáil seasta beag beann ar "
"theanga an tsuímh."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:306
msgid "Before the product summary (above the title)"
msgstr "Roimh achoimre an táirge (os cionn an teidil)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:307
msgid "Under the product image (inside the gallery)"
msgstr "Faoi íomhá an táirge (laistigh den ghailearaí)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:308
msgid "After the product title"
msgstr "Tar éis theideal an táirge"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:309
msgid "After the price"
msgstr "Tar éis an phraghais"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:310
msgid "After the short description (default)"
msgstr "Tar éis an ghearrchuntais (réamhshocraithe)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:311
msgid "After Add to cart"
msgstr "Tar éis \"Cuir sa Chairt\""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:312
msgid "After the product summary (near the tabs)"
msgstr "Tar éis achoimre an táirge (in aice leis na cluaisíní)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:326
msgid "Popup — compact summary that opens the full graphic in a dialog"
msgstr ""
"Preabfhuinneog — achoimre chomhdhlúite a osclaíonn an ghrafaic iomlán i "
"ndialóg"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:327
msgid "Full — display the full graphic directly on the page"
msgstr "Iomlán — taispeánann sé an ghrafaic iomlán go díreach ar an leathanach"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:328
msgid ""
"Nested — compact trigger that expands the full graphic in place when clicked "
"(default)"
msgstr ""
"Neadaithe — truicear comhdhlúite a leathnaíonn an ghrafaic iomlán ina háit "
"nuair a chliceáiltear air (réamhshocraithe)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:338
msgid "How the legal-guarantee notice displays on the product page."
msgstr ""
"Conas a thaispeántar an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla ar leathanach an táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:347
msgid "How the GARAN durability label displays on the product page."
msgstr ""
"Conas a thaispeántar an lipéad marthanachta GARAN ar leathanach an táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:353
msgid "Minimal — light neutral row with a chevron (default)"
msgstr "Íosta — líne neodrach éadrom le seiverón (réamhshocraithe)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:354
msgid "Classic — teal-accented row with a \"View\" button"
msgstr "Clasaiceach — líne le hairíonna dath muirghlas agus cnaipe \"Féach\""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:355
msgid "Custom — your own text, click to open the notice"
msgstr "Saincheaptha — do théacs féin, cliceáil chun an fógra a oscailt"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:357
msgid ""
"Visual style of the compact notice trigger shown in \"popup\" and \"nested\" "
"display mode, and on the checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Stíl amhairc an truicir chomhdhlúite fógra a thaispeántar sa mhodh taispeána "
"\"preabfhuinneog\" agus \"neadaithe\", agus ar leathanach an tseiceála amach."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:363
msgid ""
"Text shown on the compact notice row for every Row style — click opens the "
"legal-guarantee notice. Leave empty to use the default, \"Your legal "
"guarantee rights\", in your store's language."
msgstr ""
"Téacs a thaispeántar ar líne chomhdhlúite an fhógra do gach Stíl Líne — "
"osclaíonn cliceáil an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla. Fág folamh chun an "
"réamhshocrú, \"Do chearta ráthaíochta dlíthiúla\", a úsáid i dteanga do "
"shiopa."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:369
msgid "Font size (px)"
msgstr "Méid an chló (px)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:371
msgid ""
"Text size of the notice row for every Row style (default 14). With the "
"Custom style, the shield icon and chevron scale with it automatically."
msgstr ""
"Méid théacs líne an fhógra do gach Stíl Líne (réamhshocrú 14). Leis an stíl "
"Saincheaptha, athraíonn méid dheilbhín na sciatha agus an tseiveróin go "
"huathoibríoch leis."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:375 admin/class-eggl-settings.php:438
msgid "Shortcode:"
msgstr "Cód gairid:"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:376
msgid "Or add the \"EU Guarantee Notice\" block in the editor."
msgstr "Nó cuir an bloc \"EU Guarantee Notice\" leis san eagarthóir."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:377
msgid ""
"Always available — uses the same display mode and row style settings above. "
"Also requires \"Enable\" above to be on."
msgstr ""
"Ar fáil i gcónaí — úsáideann sé na socruithe céanna modh taispeána agus stíl "
"líne thuas. Éilíonn sé freisin go bhfuil \"Cumasaigh\" thuas air."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:382
msgid "Where the legal-guarantee notice appears on the product page."
msgstr ""
"Cá dtaispeántar an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla ar leathanach an táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:387
msgid "Where the GARAN durability label appears on the product page."
msgstr "Cá dtaispeántar an lipéad marthanachta GARAN ar leathanach an táirge."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:393
msgid "Maximum width (px)"
msgstr "Leithead uasta (px)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:395
msgid ""
"How wide the notice can grow on the product page — the compact row, the "
"expanded graphic in \"nested\" mode, and the graphic in \"full\" mode. It "
"never exceeds the space available, and the graphic keeps its proportions. "
"Default 460."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh leathan is féidir leis an bhfógra fás ar leathanach an táirge — an "
"líne chomhdhlúite, an ghrafaic leathnaithe sa mhodh \"neadaithe\", agus an "
"ghrafaic sa mhodh \"iomlán\". Ní théann sé thar an spás atá ar fáil riamh, "
"agus coinníonn an ghrafaic a comhréireanna. Réamhshocrú 460."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:401 admin/class-eggl-settings.php:416
msgid "Width (px)"
msgstr "Leithead (px)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:403
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the compact GARAN badge shown in \"popup\" and \"nested\" "
"display mode. Height adjusts automatically to keep the graphic in "
"proportion. Does not affect \"full\" display mode, which always shows the "
"complete graphic at its standard size."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé méid an tsuaitheantais chomhdhlúite GARAN a thaispeántar sa "
"mhodh taispeána \"preabfhuinneog\" agus \"neadaithe\". Coigeartaíonn an t-"
"airde go huathoibríoch chun comhréir na grafaice a choinneáil. Ní chuireann "
"sé isteach ar an modh taispeána \"iomlán\", a thaispeánann i gcónaí an "
"ghrafaic iomlán ina gnáthmhéid."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:408
msgid "Show the label at checkout for products in the basket that have one"
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an lipéad ag an seiceáil amach do tháirgí sa chiseán a bhfuil "
"ceann acu"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:409
msgid ""
"Article 8(2) of the Consumer Rights Directive names the durability label "
"among the information that must be shown directly before the consumer places "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Ainmníonn Airteagal 8(2) den Treoir um Chearta Tomhaltóirí an lipéad "
"marthanachta i measc na faisnéise nach mór a thaispeáint go díreach sula "
"gcuireann an tomhaltóir an t-ordú."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:410
msgid ""
"Works on the classic checkout and the block checkout. Also shows on the "
"classic Cart page, under each qualifying item's thumbnail image."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn sé ar an seiceáil amach clasaiceach agus ar an seiceáil amach bloc. "
"Taispeántar é freisin ar leathanach clasaiceach na Cairte, faoi mhionsamhail "
"gach míre incháilithe."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:418
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the compact GARAN badge shown at checkout and on the Cart "
"page. Kept separate from the main \"Badge width\" above, since checkout/cart "
"item rows are usually much narrower."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé méid an tsuaitheantais chomhdhlúite GARAN a thaispeántar ag an "
"seiceáil amach agus ar leathanach na Cairte. Coinnithe ar leithligh ón "
"bpríomh-\"Leithead an tsuaitheantais\" thuas, ós rud é go mbíonn línte "
"míreanna seiceála amach/cairte i bhfad níos cúinge de ghnáth."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:423
msgid "Add the GARAN durability label to WooCommerce order confirmation emails"
msgstr ""
"Cuir an lipéad marthanachta GARAN leis na ríomhphoist dheimhnithe oird "
"WooCommerce"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:424
msgid ""
"Shown to the customer only (never in the admin's copy), once per qualifying "
"product in the order, on the processing, on-hold, and completed order "
"emails, and on the customer invoice email."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánta don chustaiméir amháin (riamh i gcóip an riarthóra), uair amháin "
"do gach táirge incháilithe san ord, ar na ríomhphoist ordaithe atá á "
"bpróiseáil, ar feitheamh agus críochnaithe, agus ar an ríomhphost sonraisc "
"custaiméara."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:430
msgid "Short text line per product with a link that opens the label graphic"
msgstr ""
"Líne ghearr théacs do gach táirge le nasc a osclaíonn grafaic an lipéid"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:431
msgid "Full label graphic (embedded per product)"
msgstr "Grafaic iomlán an lipéid (leabaithe do gach táirge)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:432
msgid ""
"Short text line per product, with the label graphic sent as a file attachment"
msgstr ""
"Líne ghearr théacs do gach táirge, le grafaic an lipéid seolta mar iatán "
"comhaid"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:434
msgid ""
"\"Short text line\" keeps the email compact: product name and guarantee "
"duration, with a link that opens that product's actual GARAN badge (brand/"
"model/years) as a standalone image. \"Full label graphic\" renders that same "
"badge as a real image directly in the email for every qualifying product — "
"this adds real height with multiple products. \"Attachment\" keeps the same "
"short text line but attaches each qualifying product's label graphic as a "
"PNG file to the email instead of embedding or linking it. Rendered with the "
"bundled font and template graphic (no server configuration needed); if that "
"ever isn't possible it automatically falls back to the same short text line "
"instead of showing nothing."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn \"Líne ghearr théacs\" an ríomhphost comhdhlúite: ainm an táirge "
"agus fad na ráthaíochta, le nasc a osclaíonn suaitheantas GARAN iarbhír an "
"táirge sin (branda/samhail/blianta) mar íomhá neamhspleách. Taispeánann "
"\"Grafaic iomlán an lipéid\" an suaitheantas céanna mar íomhá iarbhír go "
"díreach sa ríomhphost do gach táirge incháilithe — cuireann sé seo airde "
"shuntasach leis nuair a bhíonn táirgí iolracha ann. Coinníonn \"Iatán\" an "
"líne ghearr théacs chéanna ach ceanglaíonn sé grafaic lipéid gach táirge "
"incháilithe mar chomhad PNG leis an ríomhphost in ionad é a leabú nó a "
"nascadh. Rindreáilte leis an gcló agus leis an ngrafaic teimpléid atá san "
"áireamh (níl aon chumraíocht freastalaí ag teastáil); mura féidir sin a "
"dhéanamh choíche, filleann sé go huathoibríoch ar an líne ghearr théacs "
"chéanna in ionad rud ar bith a thaispeáint."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:439
msgid ""
"Placed on a single product page with no attributes, it pulls the duration/"
"brand/model straight from that product's saved EU Guarantee data (Product "
"data → EU Guarantee) and only shows if that product actually qualifies."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chuirtear ar leathanach táirge amháin gan aitreabúidí é, "
"tarraingíonn sé an fad/branda/samhail go díreach ó shonraí sábháilte EU "
"Guarantee an táirge sin (Sonraí an Táirge → EU Guarantee) agus ní "
"thaispeántar é ach amháin má tá an táirge sin incháilithe iarbhír."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:440
msgid ""
"Or add the \"GARAN label\" block, which defaults to the same \"use saved "
"product data\" behaviour, or fills in the same three fields with a live "
"preview when turned off."
msgstr ""
"Nó cuir an bloc \"GARAN label\" leis, a úsáideann de réamhshocrú an t-iompar "
"céanna \"úsáid sonraí sábháilte an táirge\", nó a líonann isteach na trí "
"réimse chéanna le réamhamharc beo nuair a mhúchtar é."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:441
msgid ""
"Give it years/brand/model explicitly — e.g. [eu_garan years=\"5\" "
"brand=\"Acme\" model=\"AC-1200\"] — to override the saved product data and "
"render unconditionally wherever placed, skipping the eligibility check. Uses "
"the same display mode setting above either way. Also requires \"Enable\" "
"above to be on."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair na blianta/branda/samhail go sonrach — m.sh. [eu_garan years=\"5\" "
"brand=\"Acme\" model=\"AC-1200\"] — chun sáraíocht a dhéanamh ar shonraí "
"sábháilte an táirge agus rindreáil gan choinníoll cibé áit a gcuirtear é, ag "
"scipeáil an tseiceála incháilitheachta. Úsáideann sé an socrú modh taispeána "
"céanna thuas ar aon nós. Éilíonn sé freisin go bhfuil \"Cumasaigh\" thuas "
"air."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:446
msgid "Show the EU legal-guarantee notice on product pages"
msgstr "Taispeáin an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla AE ar leathanaigh táirgí"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:447
msgid ""
"Site-wide switch. Turn off to hide the notice everywhere, regardless of per-"
"product settings."
msgstr ""
"Lasc don suíomh iomlán. Múch chun an fógra a fholach i ngach áit, beag beann "
"ar shocruithe do tháirgí aonair."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:452
msgid "Show the GARAN durability label for qualifying products"
msgstr "Taispeáin an lipéad marthanachta GARAN do tháirgí incháilithe"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:453
msgid ""
"Site-wide switch. Turn off to hide the GARAN label everywhere, even for "
"products set up to show it. Set the manufacturer guarantee per product under "
"Product data → EU Guarantee."
msgstr ""
"Lasc don suíomh iomlán. Múch chun an lipéad GARAN a fholach i ngach áit, fiú "
"do tháirgí atá socraithe lena thaispeáint. Socraigh ráthaíocht an mhonaróra "
"do gach táirge faoi Sonraí an Táirge → EU Guarantee."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:458
msgid ""
"Show a \"Your legal guarantee rights\" sentence in the site header, on every "
"page"
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin abairt \"Do chearta ráthaíochta dlíthiúla\" i gceanntásc an "
"tsuímh, ar gach leathanach"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:459
msgid ""
"Automatically added as a menu item next to Home / Cart / Checkout — in the "
"desktop, tablet, and mobile navigation alike. The harmonised legal-guarantee "
"notice appears in a small preview on mouse roll-over, and in full on click "
"or tap. Falls back to a standalone banner if no navigation menu can be "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"Curtha leis go huathoibríoch mar mhír roghchláir in aice le Baile / Cairt / "
"Seiceáil Amach — sa nascleanúint deisce, táibléid agus soghluaiste araon. "
"Taispeántar an fógra comhchuibhithe ráthaíochta dlíthiúla i réamhamharc beag "
"nuair a bhogtar an luch os a chionn, agus ina iomláine ar chliceáil nó ar "
"chnag. Titeann sé ar ais ar bhratach neamhspleách mura féidir aon roghchlár "
"nascleanúna a réiteach."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:464
msgid ""
"Show the legal-guarantee notice on the Checkout page, under the \"Checkout\" "
"heading"
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an fógra ráthaíochta dlíthiúla ar leathanach an tSeiceála Amach, "
"faoin gceannteideal \"Checkout\""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:465
msgid ""
"Works with both the classic checkout shortcode and the block-based Checkout "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn sé leis an gcód gairid clasaiceach seiceála amach agus leis an "
"leathanach Seiceála Amach atá bunaithe ar bhlocanna araon."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:470
msgid "Add the notice to WooCommerce order confirmation emails"
msgstr "Cuir an fógra leis na ríomhphoist dheimhnithe oird WooCommerce"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:471
msgid ""
"Shown to the customer only (never in the admin's copy) on the processing, on-"
"hold, and completed order emails, and on the customer invoice email."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánta don chustaiméir amháin (riamh i gcóip an riarthóra) ar na "
"ríomhphoist ordaithe atá á bpróiseáil, ar feitheamh agus críochnaithe, agus "
"ar an ríomhphost sonraisc custaiméara."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:477
msgid "Full notice graphic (embedded image)"
msgstr "Grafaic iomlán an fhógra (íomhá leabaithe)"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:478
msgid "Short text line with a link that opens the notice graphic"
msgstr "Líne ghearr théacs le nasc a osclaíonn grafaic an fhógra"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:479
msgid "Short text line, with the notice graphic sent as a file attachment"
msgstr "Líne ghearr théacs, le grafaic an fhógra seolta mar iatán comhaid"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:481
msgid ""
"\"Full notice graphic\" is embedded directly in the email so it still shows "
"if the recipient's mail client blocks remote images by default. \"Short text "
"line\" keeps the email compact — the link opens the same official notice "
"graphic in a new tab instead. \"Attachment\" keeps that same short text line "
"but attaches the official notice graphic to the email as a file instead of "
"linking or embedding it."
msgstr ""
"Tá \"Grafaic iomlán an fhógra\" leabaithe go díreach sa ríomhphost sa chaoi "
"go dtaispeántar í fós má chuireann cliant ríomhphoist an fhaighteora bac ar "
"íomhánna cianda de réamhshocrú. Coinníonn \"Líne ghearr théacs\" an "
"ríomhphost comhdhlúite — osclaíonn an nasc an ghrafaic oifigiúil fógra "
"chéanna i gcluaisín nua. Coinníonn \"Iatán\" an líne ghearr théacs chéanna "
"ach ceanglaíonn sé grafaic oifigiúil an fhógra leis an ríomhphost mar "
"chomhad in ionad é a nascadh nó a leabú."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:486
msgid "Show a small \"Powered by GARAN Labs\" credit under the notice"
msgstr "Taispeáin creidiúint bheag \"Powered by GARAN Labs\" faoin bhfógra"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:487
msgid ""
"Off by default. Turn on only if you want to display the credit on your site."
msgstr ""
"Múchta de réamhshocrú. Cumasaigh é seo ach amháin más mian leat an "
"chreidiúint a thaispeáint ar do shuíomh."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:492
msgid "Also delete all settings when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Scrios gach socrú freisin nuair a scriostar an breiseán"

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:493
msgid ""
"Off by default — settings survive a delete/reinstall. Tick only for a clean "
"removal."
msgstr ""
"Múchta de réamhshocrú — maireann na socruithe slán tar éis scriosta/"
"athshuiteála. Ticeáil ach amháin le haghaidh baint iomlán ghlan."

#: admin/class-eggl-vendor-uploads.php:23
#: admin/class-eggl-vendor-uploads.php:24
#: admin/views/eggl-vendor-uploads-page.php:11
msgid "Vendor GARAN Labels"
msgstr "Lipéid GARAN Díoltóra"

