#: price-history/modules/digital-price-list/admin.php:45
msgid ""
"Under the regulations currently in force in Croatia, traders and service "
"providers with a website are required to publish current price lists online "
"in a machine-readable CSV or XML format and keep previous versions publicly "
"available for at least 30 days. The Digital Price List module automatically "
"generates and publishes the required product price list for your WooCommerce "
"store.<br><br><em>This information is provided for general guidance only and "
"does not constitute legal advice.</em>"
msgstr ""
"Faoi na rialacháin atá i bhfeidhm faoi láthair sa Chróit, ceanglaítear ar "
"thrádálaithe agus ar sholáthraithe seirbhíse a bhfuil suíomh gréasáin acu "
"liostaí praghsanna reatha a fhoilsiú ar líne i bhformáid CSV nó XML atá "
"inléite ag meaisín agus leaganacha roimhe sin a choinneáil ar fáil go poiblí "
"ar feadh 30 lá ar a laghad. Gineann agus foilsíonn an modúl Liosta "
"Praghsanna Digiteach an liosta praghsanna táirgí riachtanach go "
"huathoibríoch do do shiopa WooCommerce.<br><br><em>Is mar threoir "
"ghinearálta amháin a chuirtear an fhaisnéis seo ar fáil agus ní comhairle "
"dhlíthiúil í.</em>"

