#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:16
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "General"
msgstr "Ginearálta"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:21
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Configure the EU-compliant order withdrawal button (Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673). Customers use the withdrawal form page to withdraw from a "
"contract; requests appear under the Requests tab."
msgstr ""
"Cumraigh cnaipe tarraingthe siar ordaithe atá comhlíontach le rialacha an AE "
"(Treoir (AE) 2023/2673). Úsáideann custaiméirí leathanach na foirme "
"tarraingthe siar chun tarraingt siar ó chonradh; taispeántar iarratais faoin "
"gcluaisín Iarratais."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:41
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal page"
msgstr "Leathanach tarraingthe siar"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:45
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "This page should contain your withdrawal form shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Ba cheart go mbeadh cód gairid d'fhoirme tarraingthe siar ar an leathanach "
"seo."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:56
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Embed in footer"
msgstr "Leabaigh sa bhuntásc"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:57
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Embed the withdrawal button directly in the footer. Disable this option if "
"you plan to embed the page manually."
msgstr ""
"Leabaigh an cnaipe tarraingthe siar go díreach sa bhuntásc. Díchumasaigh an "
"rogha seo má tá sé ar intinn agat an leathanach a leabú de láimh."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:65
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display everywhere"
msgstr "Taispeáin i ngach áit"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:66
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display the button on every page, not just on shop-related pages."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an cnaipe ar gach leathanach, ní hamháin ar leathanaigh a "
"bhaineann leis an siopa."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:77
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Téacs an chnaipe"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:78
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Text of the withdrawal button in the footer and header menu, and of the "
"[eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button] shortcode. Leave empty to use \"Withdraw "
"from contract\" in each visitor's language. The Directive asks for wording "
"such as \"withdraw from contract here\" or an equally unambiguous phrase."
msgstr ""
"Téacs an chnaipe tarraingthe siar sa bhuntásc agus i roghchlár an "
"cheanntáisc, agus an ghearrchóid [eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button]. Fág "
"folamh chun \"Tarraing siar ón gconradh\" a úsáid i dteanga gach cuairteora. "
"Éilíonn an Treoir foclaíocht ar nós \"tarraing siar ón gconradh anseo\" nó "
"frása atá chomh soiléir céanna."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:87
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Header menu"
msgstr "Roghchlár an cheanntáisc"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Added to the main header menu (desktop and mobile). While off, the "
"withdrawal page is also kept out of the automatic page list some themes show "
"when no menu has been set up."
msgstr ""
"Curtha le príomhroghchlár an cheanntáisc (deasc agus soghluaiste). Fad is "
"atá sé múchta, coinnítear an leathanach tarraingthe siar amach freisin ón "
"liosta uathoibríoch leathanach a thaispeánann roinnt téamaí nuair nach "
"bhfuil aon roghchlár socraithe."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Show a \"Withdraw from contract\" link in the site's header menu."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin nasc \"Tarraing siar ón gconradh\" i roghchlár cheanntásc an "
"tsuímh."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:96
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Guest validation"
msgstr "Bailíochtú aíonna"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose how to validate guest withdrawal requests. Spam protection via a "
"built-in honeypot field and IP limits apply."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh conas iarratais ar tharraingt siar ó aíonna a bhailíochtú. Tá "
"cosaint ar thurscar trí réimse honeypot ionsuite agus teorainneacha IP i "
"bhfeidhm."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please note: As to current legal interpretation a validation lock would mean "
"that a consumer who makes a typo might no longer be able to submit their "
"withdrawal within the prescribed time limit—which directly contradicts the "
"protective purpose of Section 356a of the German Civil Code (BGB). Please "
"seek legal advise before using."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara: De réir an léirmhínithe dhlíthiúil reatha, chiallódh "
"glas bailíochtaithe go mb'fhéidir nach mbeadh tomhaltóir a dhéanann botún "
"clóscríofa in ann a tharraingt siar a sheoladh laistigh den teorainn ama "
"forordaithe a thuilleadh—rud a théann go díreach i gcoinne chuspóir cosanta "
"Alt 356a de Chód Sibhialta na Gearmáine (BGB). Faigh comhairle dhlíthiúil "
"sula n-úsáideann tú é."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:103
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Enforce that the order number entered exists."
msgstr "Éiligh go bhfuil uimhir an ordaithe a iontráladh ann."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:104
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Order must exist and email must match the one from the original order."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh an t-ordú a bheith ann agus caithfidh an ríomhphost a bheith mar "
"an gcéanna leis an gceann ón ordú bunaidh."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:105
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Either order number or email address must exist."
msgstr "Caithfidh uimhir an ordaithe nó an seoladh ríomhphoist a bheith ann."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:106
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not validate"
msgstr "Ná bailíochtaigh"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:111
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Partial withdrawals"
msgstr "Tarraingtí siar páirteacha"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:112
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Allow customers and verified guests to select which order items to withdraw."
msgstr ""
"Lig do chustaiméirí agus d'aíonna fíoraithe na míreanna ordaithe atá le "
"tarraingt siar a roghnú."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:120
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Mandatory fields"
msgstr "Réimsí éigeantacha"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:122
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Select fields that should be mandatory while submitting a new withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh réimsí ar cheart dóibh a bheith éigeantach agus tarraingt siar nua "
"á seoladh"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:142
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Allow guests to enter additional information in a separate text field."
msgstr "Lig d'aíonna faisnéis bhreise a iontráil i réimse téacs ar leith."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:150
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Non-refundable"
msgstr "Neamh-inaisíoctha"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:151
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Choose certain product types to exclude from being withdrawn."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cineálacha áirithe táirgí le heisiamh ó tharraingt siar."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:162
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal period"
msgstr "Tréimhse tarraingthe siar"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:163
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of days, starting with the orders' completed date, to "
"accept withdrawals for orders."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh líon na laethanta, ag tosú ó dháta críochnaithe na n-orduithe, "
"chun glacadh le tarraingtí siar d'orduithe."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Laethanta"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the withdrawal period does not begin until the customer "
"receives the order. If necessary add a buffer period depending on your "
"shipping process. Use 0 to make withdrawals available at any time."
msgstr ""
"Coinnigh i gcuimhne nach dtosaíonn an tréimhse tarraingthe siar go dtí go "
"bhfaigheann an custaiméir an t-ordú. Más gá, cuir tréimhse mhaolánach leis "
"ag brath ar do phróiseas seolta. Úsáid 0 chun tarraingtí siar a chur ar fáil "
"ag am ar bith."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:174
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Unverified requests"
msgstr "Iarratais neamhfhíoraithe"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not adjust order status for unverified requests."
msgstr "Ná coigeartaigh stádas an ordaithe d'iarratais neamhfhíoraithe."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"For some requests, the email address differs from the original stored within "
"the order. Make sure these requests do not automatically set the pending "
"withdrawal order status."
msgstr ""
"I gcás roinnt iarratas, tá an seoladh ríomhphoist difriúil ón gceann bunaidh "
"atá stóráilte san ordú. Déan cinnte nach socraíonn na hiarratais seo stádas "
"ordaithe na tarraingthe siar ar feitheamh go huathoibríoch."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:183
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "Ríomhphost teagmhála"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:184
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please provide an email address where customers can contact you if they have "
"any issues."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair seoladh ríomhphoist inar féidir le custaiméirí teagmháil a dhéanamh "
"leat má bhíonn aon fhadhbanna acu."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:194
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "My account page"
msgstr "Leathanach mo chuntais"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"On the my account page, add a link to create a new withdrawal request for "
"the order in case available."
msgstr ""
"Ar leathanach mo chuntais, cuir nasc leis chun iarratas nua ar tharraingt "
"siar a chruthú don ordú más féidir."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Shown as a \"Withdraw\" button next to \"View\" in My account → Orders, and "
"under \"Actions\" when the customer opens an order. It only appears for "
"orders that can still be withdrawn: processing or completed, within the "
"withdrawal period, with items left to withdraw, and once the withdrawal page "
"is published."
msgstr ""
"Taispeántar é mar chnaipe \"Tarraing siar\" in aice le \"Féach\" i Mo "
"chuntas → Orduithe, agus faoi \"Gníomhartha\" nuair a osclaíonn an "
"custaiméir ordú. Ní thaispeántar é ach d'orduithe is féidir a tharraingt "
"siar fós: á bpróiseáil nó críochnaithe, laistigh den tréimhse tarraingthe "
"siar, le míreanna fágtha le tarraingt siar, agus nuair atá an leathanach "
"tarraingthe siar foilsithe."

